      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "evidence that the suspect refused to comply with any reasonable direction in connection with the carrying out of the forensic procedure; or evidence that the suspect obstructed, resisted, hindered, used violence against, threatened or intimidated a person in connection with the carrying out of the forensic procedure;",
