    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-37-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The act overlaps with the judicial proceeding.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal overlap: The act and the judicial proceeding overlap.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Overlaps",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person does an act; and  (b) the person does so with the intention of inducing a person called, or to be called, as a witness in a judicial proceeding:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-37-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person commits an offence.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to not induce false testimony in a judicial proceeding.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person does an act; and  (b) the person does so with the intention of inducing a person called, or to be called, as a witness in a judicial proceeding:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-37-ss-3-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person must not induce false testimony.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition on inducing false testimony in a judicial proceeding.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibition",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person does an act; and  (b) the person does so with the intention of inducing a person called, or to be called, as a witness in a judicial proceeding:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-37-ss-3-logic-ltl-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The act occurs before the judicial proceeding.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal until: The act occurs before the judicial proceeding.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Until",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person does an act; and  (b) the person does so with the intention of inducing a person called, or to be called, as a witness in a judicial proceeding:"
    },
